<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conjure-magma</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conjure Magma Elemental</ansi> spell forces a magma elemental through the
planar boundary and binds it as your companion. The magma elemental
combines the crushing mass of an earth elemental with the searing heat
of fire, able to knock enemies prone and to burn anyone foolish enough
to strike it with bare flesh.

The casting itself is not ruinous. The keeping is. No other binding in
the game holds as much of your will, so a magma elemental will usually
be the only companion you can carry, and the choice to call one is
really a choice to field one strong creature instead of several weaker
ones.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conjure-magma</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Neutral
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Manifestation
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> Extended channel
  <ansi fg="yellow">Cast Cost:   </ansi> Steep, and paid only once
  <ansi fg="yellow">Held Cost:   </ansi> Heaviest of any binding, while you keep it

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - No component is required to cast this spell.
  - The magma elemental has a natural bash ability and returns
    burn damage to enemies that strike it with flesh or claws.
  - The elemental persists until destroyed or dismissed.
  - Calling it costs conviction once. Keeping it sets conviction
    aside for as long as it stays with you, and that held share,
    not the casting price, is what limits how many you can field.
  - A mightier elemental holds more of your will. That is the real
    trade between one elemental and another.
  - Skill in manifestation lowers what a companion holds, so
    practice buys you a larger following as well as a stronger one.
  - A conjured elemental is the same wherever you stand. No remains
    are needed and none are consumed.
  - If your conviction is already spoken for, the binding is refused
    outright rather than leaving you weaker, and costs you nothing.

